    "detailed_description": "<i>A symbiosis with ancient shadows. A tower full of demons. A proverb. </i><br><br>Doko Roko is an atmospheric 2D action platformer with a focus on swift, evasive sword combat. Slash your way through hordes of demons as you ascend the floors of an ancient tower ravaged by time. What visions await one who is forced to be reborn? Onward and upward, Unslain.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced melee combat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A variety of swords with different abilities, strengths, and weaknesses</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple challenging boss battles</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ambient story-telling</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lush soundtrack by Seltzki</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A non-traditional atmospheric pixel-art style </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Secrets </li></ul>",
